 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-09","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.36","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.36/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"876ee7a815fcb462c28cead833dae9e0dae38b98b170567897e4588c3b3f5858"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.36/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"fe11f53d4b3eb60688550ffc55a21e62ab55cac97b992a3e19141bc15cf915dd"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.36/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"06b4903e403a2fc5554fb3b40566c5b38a27333c9a5f0b831d270bcc17b863aa"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.36/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"40573d79328bf06a8de4d7eae51464b0de2861a04b73a97e2dc035cd4e5b0ef3"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.36"}